Package: flickos-style-seven
Architecture: all
# flickos-layouts 1.53: check tests a see-through panel color; arc-theme and
# numix-icon-theme: the GTK and icon themes Seven names (on every FlickOS
# system already, so installing it adds only its own files).
Depends: flickos-layouts (>= 1.53),
         arc-theme,
         numix-icon-theme,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: Seven style for the FlickOS desktop
 A light style for FlickOS: windows in the Arc theme with the Numix icons,
 see-through sky blue title bars and frames, a see-through dark blue
 panel, a black terminal, a light app launcher and notifications, and a
 sky wallpaper with FlickOS's halo. It suits the Redmond layout.
 .
 Installing it adds Seven to Desktop Layout & Style, next to Dark and
 Light; "flickos-layout try seven" shows it until the next login.
